; | FOR MODDERS: 
; | When MAS-patching a weapon, set the scope group to the largest group it can support.
; | When adding a sight, set the scope group to the smallest scope group it falls into.
; | 
; | These scope groups will ensure a weapon does not have clipping issues with too-large sights.
; | These scope groups will ensure a sight does not have floating issues with too-short rails.


; - All* rail lengths measured by distance from start of scope_base ACOG mount to end of scope rail
; - All* physical lengths measured by distance from end of ACOG model scope housing to end of scope model
; * Measurements for tiny group and smaller are by sight alone.
; - All lengths measured by meters, scaled to MAS base scale.


[scope_group_picatinny_2inch]
	scopes = placeholder

; -- Pistol sights. Only use if rail space fits less than the C-More. 
; -- For sights with this group, ensure their position is similar to other sights in the group.
;	| Largest allowable rail length: 	0.050m
;	| Largest allowable physical length: 	Unrestricted

[scope_group_picatinny_tiny]:scope_group_picatinny_2inch


; -- Smallest non-pistol sights. Only use if rail space fits less than the ACOG to the Aimpoint. 
; -- For sights with this group, ensure their position is similar to other sights in the group.
;	| Largest allowable rail length: 	0.070m
;	| Largest allowable physical length: 	Unrestricted


[scope_group_picatinny_short_phys]:scope_group_picatinny_tiny

; -- Small sights. For use when clipping with longer scopes occurs (eg. front sight posts). 
;	| Largest allowable rail length: 	0.097m 
;	| Largest allowable physical length: 	0.155m


[scope_group_picatinny_short]:scope_group_picatinny_short_phys

; -- Sights with short rail space.
;	| Largest allowable rail length: 	0.097m
;	| Largest allowable physical length: 	0.220m

[scope_group_picatinny_medium]:scope_group_picatinny_short

; -- Medium sized scopes. Larger rail space.
;	| Largest allowable rail length: 	0.177m
;	| Largest allowable physical length: 	0.220m

[scope_group_picatinny_long]:scope_group_picatinny_medium

; -- Long scopes. Large rail space
;	| Largest allowable rail length: 	0.200m
;	| Largest allowable physical length: 	0.285m

![scope_group_picatinny]:scope_group_picatinny_long

; -- All picatinny sights. Set for use with the longest of sights and weapons.
;	| Largest allowable rail length: 	Unrestricted
;	| Largest allowable physical length:	Unrestricted